---
title: ProveNFix Temporal Property-Guided Program Repair
author: Yahui Song, Zhen Dong, Yufei Li, Jiangchao Liu, Chengpeng Wang, Yulei Sui, and Jingling Xue
year: 2024
---

# Abstract

Recent program repair techniques have achieved promising results in fixing bugs, yet they remain ineffective in repairing temporal bugs due to the lack of bug detectors that can capture the rich temporal and spatial contexts of such bugs. This paper presents ProveNFix, the first temporal property-guided program repair approach. ProveNFix leverages temporal properties to automatically detect and fix temporal bugs. We evaluate ProveNFix on 10 real-world projects, and the experimental results show that ProveNFix can detect and fix temporal bugs effectively.

